In lib/kompanion.js, function runJob(run, user, email) turns a Kompanion Studio run into a Studio job (3D-01; the test `runJob: a 3D run shows its preview and offers the .glb` in test/library.test.js already exists, do not change tests). A run of type 'image-to-3d' has two outputs: names[0] ends in .glb (the model) and names[1] is its preview picture (.png). Make such a run a job with:
- kind 'model' (in the `if (run.type === 'music' ...) ... else kind = 'image'` choice);
- images: only the outputs whose name does not end in .glb, each as { filename, subfolder: '', kompanion: n } with n the output's own index;
- files: only the .glb outputs, each as { name, mime: 'model/gltf-binary', kompanion: n }.
All other run types keep exactly what they get today (images for pictures and video, files for music/sfx). Keep the change inside runJob, as small as possible.
